    "text": "theorcasonian.com\nwebsite\nSan Juan County, Washington\nSan Juan County officially rejoins NWCAA\n7 hours ago\nIsland, San Juan, Skagit, and Whatcom counties formed the Northwest Air Pollution Authority (now NWCAA) in 1967 under authority granted by the Washington Clean Air Act. San Juan County withdrew its membership in the early 1980s. At their July 10 meeting, NWCAA Board members adopted a resolution making the reunion...",
